            "detailed_description": "In 1915, before the Dardanelles War,<br />\r\nThe heroic story of two soldiers who served in the Ottoman Empire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nstory<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbdullah and Mehmet are two experienced soldiers who served in the Ottoman Empire.<br />\r\nThey fall captive in a battle they've been fighting. They are obliged to continue their lives in the country where they are taken prisoner by depriving them of their freedom. They accept the situation and continue their lives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProblems encountered while pursuing their objectives are reflected in their experiences of war, intelligence and skill<br />\r\nThey will have to confront their fears when they solve it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame<br />\r\nDespite the fact that our game is a 'FPS' game, Puzzles, a lot of problems to solve, extraordinary environments that will force your imagination and test your attention.",
